        "kind": "duration",
        "requirement": "'immediate stop' — the halt must follow the observation of the red signal without delay; the allowed reaction interval must be declared"
      },
      {
        "kind": "until",
        "requirement": "the subject may not overtake or proceed past until the flashing red signal ceases operation"
      },
      {
